{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nyanzou never cleans up after playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Kumakichi tells him to, Nyanzou heads outside to play without cleaning anything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with rage, Kumakichi decides in his heart to destroy everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy, destroy, and destroy them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kumakichi\u2019s destruction action game is here and now available  in full DX glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Kumakichi's Birth \u2606 Destruction God to even more in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more stages in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new ultimate moves in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full voice acting and more content in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to customize characters in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come experience DX destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The PC version does not have online battle functionality. Instead, you can play single player on maps that are used in online battles on other platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Settings change keys]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: End game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11: Switch to full screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 (title screen): Switch language</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stage1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635960/71e3a0148704cad47653c5a83c7f664cf6b4ca19.jpg"},{"name":"Stage2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635960/a52544409e183c7b144a8123db361357c5e3657d.jpg"},{"name":"Stage3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635960/276f4513f28ab52441d3eb692e618e72a61436b3.jpg"},{"name":"Stage4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/